  "id": "feature-abstraction",
  "term": "feature abstraction",
  "definition": "Feature abstraction is the process in a layered learning system of turning input data through successive nonlinear steps into increasingly higher-level representations. In this hierarchy, later layers capture more discriminative and meaningful patterns than earlier layers, helping the model learn complex structure in the data.",
